<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Communication Centre — PulseReach</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/app.css?v=9"></head><body class="app"><aside class="sidebar"><a class="brand" href="/dashboard"><span class="brand-mark"><img src="/images/pulsereach-logo.png" alt="PulseReach logo"></span> PulseReach</a><div class="org"><small>ORGANIZER</small><b><%= organizer.name %></b><span><%= organizer.organization %></span></div><nav class="side-nav"><a href="/dashboard">⌂ Overview</a><a href="/dashboard#drives">◷ Drives</a><a href="/participants">♙ Participants</a><a href="/reminders">✦ Reminders</a><a class="active" href="/communications">✉ Communications</a><a href="/participants">✓ Attendance</a><a href="/participants">◌ Consent</a><% if (['OWNER','MANAGER'].includes(organizer.role)) { %><a href="/volunteers">♙ Volunteers</a><a href="/audit">◌ Audit trail</a><% } %></nav><div class="side-bottom"><form method="post" action="/logout"><button class="side-logout">Sign out</button></form></div></aside><main class="main"><div class="page-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">COMMUNICATION ENGINE</div><h1>Personalised communication</h1><p>Generate consent-aware messages using language, confirmation, response behaviour and time remaining.</p><div class="inline-actions compact-actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/reminders">✦ Intelligent reminders</a></div></div></div><div class="notice"><b>How it works</b><p>Gemini is the notification decision and message engine. PulseReach enforces consent and the post-donation pause first, then Gemini decides whether a notification is useful and generates its message. Notifications appear in the donor dashboard; no external SMS/WhatsApp/email provider is connected in this prototype. Post-donation pause is enforced before Gemini can generate a notification.</p></div><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>Generate for a drive</h2><p>Only participants who have current-drive communication consent are included.</p></div></div><div class="drive-list"><% if (!drives.length) { %><div class="empty-state"><b>No drives yet.</b><p>Create a drive before generating communication.</p></div><% } %><% drives.forEach(d => { %><div class="communication-drive"><div><b><%= d.name %></b><small><%= d.venue %> · <%= new Date(d.date).toLocaleString('en-IN') %></small></div><form method="post" action="/communications/preview-drive/<%= d._id %>"><button class="btn btn-primary">Generate previews</button></form></div><% }) %></div></section><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>Recent generated previews</h2><p>Every preview records the language, stage, consent check and generation source.</p></div></div><div class="message-list"><% if (!logs.length) { %><div class="empty-state"><b>No messages generated yet.</b><p>Generate a preview for a participant or drive to see it here.</p></div><% } %><% logs.forEach(log => { %><article class="message-card"><div class="message-meta"><span class="status"><%= log.generatedBy %></span><span><%= log.stage %></span><span><%= log.language %></span><span><%= new Date(log.createdAt).toLocaleString('en-IN') %></span><span class="<%= log.readAt ? 'read-status' : 'unread-status' %>"><%= log.readAt ? '✓ Read' : 'Unread' %></span></div><p><%= log.message %></p><small><%= log.participantId?.name || 'Participant' %> · <%= log.driveId?.name || 'Drive' %> · engagement: <%= log.readCount || 0 %></small></article><% }) %></div></section></main><script src="/js/pulsereach-assistant.js?v=1"></script></body></html>
